
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `cp-dominio`
IMPORT `cp-pena`
IMPORT `cp-g1c-comum`
IMPORT `cp-g1c-prescricao`
IMPORT `cp-g1c-livramento-condicional`

-- Independent test pass, ta-g1, cases IT-g1-271 to IT-g1-339 (arts. 109–117).
-- The expected values were written from the source alone on 2026-09-29,
-- before the encoding existed (~/.claude/br-penal-oracle/cases/ta-g1.json).
-- Each case is ONE directive below, headed by its id and question. The
-- expected value is the case's; it is never changed to match the encoding.
-- Where a case states no date, the dates chosen here fall after 4.7.2025, so
-- that the current wording of every article answers; where a case states a
-- date, that date is used as stated. Cases IT-g1-329 and IT-g1-333 are not
-- expressible and have no directive (notes/independent-g1.md).

§ `Teste independente ta-g1 — prescrição (arts. 109 a 117)`

§§ `Pessoas`

GIVETH A Pessoa
`ind Beto, nascido em 1.1.1980` MEANS
    Pessoa WITH
        `identificação` IS "Beto"
        `data de nascimento` IS YMD 1980 1 1
        mulher IS FALSE

GIVETH A Pessoa
`ind Caio, nascido em 1.6.2005` MEANS
    Pessoa WITH
        `identificação` IS "Caio"
        `data de nascimento` IS YMD 2005 6 1
        mulher IS FALSE

